==Icelandic==
===Adverb===
'''fyrst''' 
# ({{superl}} of ''[[snemma]]'') [[first]]
#: ''Við [[kaupa inn|kaupum]] '''fyrst''' [[kaupa inn|inn]].''
#:: We [[do the shopping]] '''first'''.

====Derived terms====
*[[fyrst í stað]] (to begin with, at first)
*[[fyrst um sinn]] (for the time being)
*[[sem allra fyrst]] (as soon as possible)
*[[fyrst og fremst]] ([[first and foremost]])

[[Category:Icelandic adverbs]]

===Adjective===
'''fyrst''' 

# the feminine of ''[[fyrstur]]'' meaning "[[first]]"
# the neuter of ''[[fyrstur]]'' meaning "[[first]]"

[[Category:Icelandic adjective forms]]
[[Category:is:Ordinal numbers]]

===Conjunction===
'''fyrst'''
# [[since]]
#: '''''Fyrst''' þú heimsóttir mig á spítalann þá fyrirgef ég þér.''
#:: '''Since''' you visited me in the hospital I forgive you.

[[Category:Icelandic conjunctions]]

